<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-06T08:05:45.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 08:05:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Turkey has stepped up airstrikes to support President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud, raising civilian casualties, while Uganda is accelerating its withdrawal from Somalia and Ethiopia is planning a similar pullout as fighting intensifies. The United States has left the strategic Baledogle airfield, but U.S. forces and an East African nation continue joint airstrikes against al-Shabaab. Somali forces have been urged by the army chief to intensify operations against al-Shabaab near Barawe, and a Somali police officer was killed by an aircraft propeller at Dhusamareb Airport. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNOVlNOGdWZGNMcExOVVJvcWJoUTIzdVl2X3A1MWNmbzZyd2M5cFBPZmJ3SnQtMFBYdFdXMFhCdDhsX2QzY0lHYkF0Z216VVo0MUV0azNTRE1wUnAtUTZZM0lKdldFUDRxTE5Md004ZzBkS1dMTGVuWmlSZHhyemtmN0N6cTFqQ3lFeC1NRHgwUlh6SV93OVZkU0ZKbDFsZGtFeUhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNQzRTTFlYakw2WUUybFk0OWdoMzVxbHR3ckFLbVVnb21DRmJOenFVb3ZSS3lDWDlvTXZuUG9fOFcyN3JrUko0MERUMWVwTXRTQm9qUjcxRk1xaWNqbENuSmpEeS1MQzhLWmpiaXRsU2U4ZFhiWnFjbGtCbEtjSENOS3h1b1hJdW5RR3BvcWRBUVVlLXhNNzRocEtoTFRGM1BuaDVSc3lvdTltdk1lT0VQU1ZjOWRsQ2U4YkUyU2FfSldCZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQTjdsaHJxNmZZTEVkeFlGdHRqXzN4Z1RHV1ZZUThqQkFhRHJVNnBtNmdiRjN6cDZCWmVoNHlpcUhKVk9vdFJwYVBJckt3RFp2U1RYbGVLclBWX0VZRjhGcU84S0tQQmkzUzh2VzN2ci1rU3RSTlQ1V0xFRDVoMFFSbUY5amRaN3JoMnY4YVRBTklWdFJ0YW1XeXoyWm9KbmF2YUQ2ZmFsT0xZX09fOWtNOEwxamNFSnZ5NzdFT3dNbzNIZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Nation&lt;/a&gt;,